<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Force Master Dragonchar Animation Cancel</Major>
    <Description>Force Master Fragonchar rotation 
Skill Requirements: 
Dragonchar(2)
Shock Fire(1)
Bleazing Palm(R)
Bale Fire(C)
Meteor Shower(V)

You must cast Dragonchar(2) as much as possible. You need a lot of focus while spamming Dragonchar(2). 

Blazing Palm(R),Bale Fire(C) and Meteor Shower(V) are giving you focus, 

Also Shock Fire(1) gives you a lot of focus and its cooldown is short So you must always cast Shock Fire(1) when its cooldown is up.

Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download </Comment>
